Digital Celebris XL Pentium Pro Series

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Allows fast, smooth upgrades to the fastest Intel Pentium, Pentium Pro,
   and Digital Alpha-based processors

o  Enables effective deployment of business solutions on Microsoft Windows
   and Windows NT platforms

o  Offers new feature set additions, including Pentium Pro models bundled
   with a Matrox MGA Millennium 2D/3D 64-bit PCI graphics adapter, and
   models featuring an Accel Graphics AG300 PCI 3D graphics adapter

DESCRIPTION

The Digital Celebris XL Pentium Pro Series is targeted at the rapidly
expanding market of Windows NTbased workstations.  The Celebris XL is a
high-performance yet affordable personal workstation that's ideal for the
technical user. It offers the highest level of Intel price/performance
for mission-critical computing, and simultaneously provides the full
suite of Windows-based software running under Windows NT.

The Digital Celebris XL delivers workstation-class power at PC prices
with a combination of CISC-to-RISC upgradability to a 266-MHz Alpha
processor and support for a wide range of 32-bit operating systems. The
Celebris XL is designed for performance-intensive scientific/technical,
graphical design, statistical analysis, MCAD, ECAD, database management,
and software development applications.

