Digital Driver V1.0 for cc:Mail

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Allows cc:Mail for Windows users to employ MailWorks software on OpenVMS
   and Digital UNIX systems

o  Provides improved dependability and enhanced security over LAN mail
   file-sharing technology

o  Offers updated licensing and packaging

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

Digital Driver V1.0 for cc:Mail (previously referred to as cc:Mail
Connection for MailWorks V1.0) allows cc:Mail for Windows V2.0 and V2.1
to connect to the MailWorks for OpenVMS and MailWorks for UNIX servers.
This connection enables cc:Mail users to take advantage of MailWorks
client/server technology while continuing to use their familiar user
interfaces.

Directory Services (DDS) are provided by MailWorks servers via MAILbus
Services (VAX Messager Router/DDS or DEC X.500 Directory Service), as is
connectivity to all other MAILbus gateways and complementary products in
the enterprise system. A personal address book with support for free-form
addressing is also available.

