QM-4BTAA-AA  Back End License
QB-4BTAA-SA  Back End License (CD-ROM Package)
QA-36DAA-GZ  Documentation Kit

SERVICES

Layered Product Support Services are available for Reliable Transaction
Router V3.1 for Windows NT. This software is usually sold in
mission-critical projects that require consulting services.

TECHNICAL DATA

Reliable Transaction Router V3.1 for Windows NT configurations are
application dependent, but typically include multiple client, router, and
server nodes. Software prerequisites are the operating system (Windows NT
3.5 or greater) and networking software (TCP/IP or DECnet products).
Applications can be developed in languages such as C and C++. Server
applications typically utilize database software; for example, Oracle7,
Rdb7, and Sybase. See the Reliable Transaction Router V3.1 for Windows NT
Software Product Description (SPD 53.88) for information on
interoperability with OpenVMS systems.
