Embedded Wide SCSI Options for AlphaServer 8200 and 8400 Systems

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Wide SCSI drives now supported as internal systems options on AlphaServer
   8200 and 8400 platforms

o  Unique StorageWorks Plug-In-Unit shelves required

o  16-bit wide SCSI operation requires the use of appropriate wide drives,
   controllers, and cables

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

AlphaServer 8200 and AlphaServer 8400 5/300 systems now support (16-bit)
wide and (8-bit) narrow SCSI devices in new wide SCSI shelves. The
AlphaServer 8200 systems require the BA356-JB shelf; AlphaServer 8400
systems require the BA660-AB or BA661-AA shelves.

Wide SCSI disks can improve the performance of applications that need
very high bandwidth I/O data transfers.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

